# Advisories `make deps` accepts, each until its expiry. One entry per line:
#   <advisory id> #<issue> <expires YYYY-MM-DD, at most 90 days out> <reason>
#   PYSEC-2021-66 #12 2026-12-31 no fixed release yet; the template path is not used
# Only the owner adds an entry; the agent never does (AGENTS.md §3), and the owner's merge is the review.
# An entry past its expiry, more than 90 days out, or missing a field turns `make deps` red
# (scripts/deps_accept.py). Ships empty.
